;; Personal Assistant user settings.
;;
;; Uncomment and edit what you want to change. Precedence, highest first:
;;   environment variable  >  project .env (dev)  >  this file  >  built-in default
;;
;; This file is read with aero, so any value here may be #env FOO (the real
;; environment, then the project .env) or #or [#env FOO "default"] — handy for
;; keeping API keys and tokens out of the file itself. #setting is the one tag
;; that does not work here: it reads *from* this file.
